始数据类型，以避免低精度下 `Linspace` 和 `Pow` 运算的精度损失。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **中间计算精度提升**: 新增 `isNeedCast` 判断逻辑，当 `result_dtype` 为 `DT_FLOAT16` 或 `DT_BF16` 时，将计算数据类型 `compute_dtype` 设为 `DT_FLOAT`，使 `ScalarToTensor`、`Linspace`、`InplacePow` 均在 `FP32` 下执行。\n- **结果类型回退**: 在 `InplacePow` 之后、`ViewCopy` 之前插入条件性的 `l0op::Cast` 调用，将升精度计算得到的 `pow_result` 转换回原始的 `result_dtype`。\n- **ViewCopy 输入调整**: `l0op::ViewCopy` 的输入由原来的 `pow_result` 改为 `cast_result`（升精度场景下为 `Cast` 后的结果，否则为 `pow_result` 原值）。\n- **代码格式修正**: 修复了 `l0op::Linspace` 调用中 `uniqueExecutor.get()` 前缺少空格的格式问题。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-29T21:17:01+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-29T21:17:01+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177719419,"discussion_id":"75c207686f8440ed14c9cd0442aa4e7bdef46993","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-29T21:19:50+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-29T21:19:50+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177727467,"discussion_id":"f6d79e72fe1b6d7b61d364c085b9e220accbc15e","body":"### Notification  \nThis pull request has been changed(code update) or closed, so removes the following label(s): stat/needs-squash.","created_at":"2026-06-29T22:02:05+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-29T22:02:05+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec